### 1. 注册设备 SENSOR-001
POST http://localhost:8082/api/iot/devices/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "SENSOR-001",
  "type": "THERMOSTAT",
  "location": "Warehouse-1"
}

### 2. (正常) 上报遥测数据
POST http://localhost:8082/api/iot/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "SENSOR-001",
  "temperature": 25.5,
  "humidity": 45.2,
  "battery": 98.0
}

### 3. (告警) 上报高温数据
POST http://localhost:8082/api/iot/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "SENSOR-001",
  "temperature": 85.0,
  "humidity": 10.0,
  "battery": 95.0
}

### 4. 模拟随机设备上线
POST http://localhost:8082/api/iot/simulate

### 5. 查看实时监控大屏 (Redis Data)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/iot/dashboard

### 6. 查看设备列表 (DB)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/iot/devices

### 7. 查看告警记录 (DB)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/iot/alarms
